              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oku ovupi azoru alatara kokoru a’bi suzasiri pie; adaru ’ba dria kani agupiru kani okuru, afani razu yi ma ruaasi ’diyi pi dri, ’ba lapi oku alatara kokoruri beri be.",
          "type": "text",
